      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Veering Miss",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Trigger Artus misses but doesn't critically miss with a soul arrow longbow Strike\n\n---\n\nEffect The arrow veers back and attempts to hit the target again. Artus attempts a new ranged Strike using the same multiple attack penalty as the missed Strike. This veering attack doesn't count toward Artus's multiple attack penalty. This new attack roll ignores cover and greater cover."
